eply questionable decision. Your feedback helped shape this patch.What improved?- Added **Master**, **Music**, **Sound Effects**, and **Proximity Voice** volume controls to the in-game pause menu.- Ducks can no longer be placed in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T13:03:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446429","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001220-1842846814446244","game_id":"steam-5001220","kind":"announcement","title":"A New Way to Cause Absolute Duck Chaos!","summary":"Hey hey, duck detectives! 🦆The latest DUCK DUCK GONE Demo update introduces Duck Heist—a new default game mode filled with stolen ducks, frantic chases, last-second rescues, and desperate escapes.Finding a hidden duck is no longer the end of the story.Pick it up, carry it across the map, and reach the getaway pond before its owner catches you. If someone steals your duck, chase them down, recover it, and hide it again before they escape!How Duck Heist WorksHide your duck somewhere clever.Search ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T11:59:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446244","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001220-1842846814443587","game_id":"steam-5001220","kind":"announcement","title":"Something New Is Waddling Into DUCK DUCK GONE Demo… 🦆","summary":"Hey, duck detectives!Things have been getting suspicious around the pond.We’ve been reading your feedback and working hard on the next DUCK DUCK GONE update. Our goal is simple: make every match more exciting, more polished, and much more fun to replay.The update will include:New game modes with fresh ways to create duck-related chaosImproved gameplay, pacing, and objective clarityMore satisfying effects, animations, music, and soundSmarter bots and a better solo experiencePerformance and stabil","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-03T14:53:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814443587","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001220-1841579228678388","game_id":"steam-5001220","kind":"announcement","title":"100 Wishlists! Thank You for Joining the Flock 🦆","summary":"100 Wishlists! Thank You for Joining the Flock 🦆Today, DUCK DUCK GONE reached its first 100 wishlists!That means 100 people saw a suspicious rubber duck and thought, “Yes. I need to know where this is going.”As a solo developer, this means far more to me than a number on a dashboard. Every wishlist tells Steam that people are interested—but it also tells me this strange little idea is connecting with someone.Thank you to everyone who watched the trailer, played the Demo, shared the game, sent fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T14:00:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678388","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5001220-1841579228677684","game_id":"steam-5001220","kind":"announcement","title":"The DUCK DUCK GONE Demo Is Live — Let the Quacking Begin!","summary":"The DUCK DUCK GONE Demo Is Live — Let the Quacking Begin!The doors are open. The ducks are loose. The evidence is questionably hidden.The free DUCK DUCK GONE demo is now live on Steam!Hide an identical rubber duck while everyone watches. Then hunt their ducks, protect your hiding spot, unleash ridiculous powers, and act innocent when somebody approaches your masterpiece.In the demo you can:Explore the Mall, Mansion, and OfficePlay with friends or fill empty seats with botsCause chaos using Egg, ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T08:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677684","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5001220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5001220":"2026-10-26T16:20:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5001220":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:13Z"},"5088500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:14Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5001220","app_id":5001220,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"14de0fb22c1486b25a97055fed2273d3f5021570270f38b9e5310caeda8be768","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Hide a rubber duck in plain sight, then hunt down everyone else’s in this chaotic online party game for up to 8 players. Paint it, resize it, fool your friends and pray the reveal camera is kind.","publishers":[{"name":"TonyHS"}],"developers":[{"name":"TonyHS"}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1798704000,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_year"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Duck Heist Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/app